{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/1053","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/1053/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/1053/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/1053/events","html_url":"https://github.com/libgeos/geos/issues/1053","id":2168534279,"node_id":"I_kwDOACh1KM6BQTUH","number":1053,"title":"ST_Relate gives incorrect result for interior-interior intersection dimension","user":{"login":"cuteDen-ECNU","id":93959004,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZmzXA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93959004?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuteDen-ECNU","html_url":"https://github.com/cuteDen-ECNU","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuteDen-ECNU/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuteDen-ECNU/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuteDen-ECNU/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuteDen-ECNU/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuteDen-ECNU/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuteDen-ECNU/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuteDen-ECNU/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuteDen-ECNU/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cuteDen-ECNU/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":1961427520,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTYxNDI3NTIw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"d32304","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2024-03-05T07:53:12Z","updated_at":"2024-11-26T00:28:34Z","closed_at":"2024-11-26T00:28:34Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Considering the following statement:\r\n```sql\r\nSELECT ST_Relate(g1, g2)\r\n  FROM (VALUES\r\n  ('MULTILINESTRING((2 4, 10 10),(15 10,10 5,5 10))'::geometry, \r\n   'MULTILINESTRING((2 4, 10 10))'::geometry)\r\n  ) AS sdb(g1, g2);\r\n\r\n--expected{ 1F1F001F2}; actual{ 0F1F001F2}\r\n```\r\n\r\n```shell \r\nbin/geosop -a 'MULTILINESTRING((2 4, 10 10),(15 10,10 5,5 10))' -b 'MULTILINESTRING((2 4, 10 10))' relate\r\n# expected{ 1F1F001F2}; actual{ 0F1F001F2}\r\n```\r\nThe intersection of interior-interior of g1 and g2 is `LINESTRING(2 4, 10 10)` whose dimension is 1. Thus the de9im code should be 1F1F001F2 instead of 0F1F001F2.\r\n\r\nThe version of Geos is the latest one:\r\n[bdceea6](https://github.com/libgeos/geos/commit/bdceea69174e80cf2cc2959d6da8d9dd0e766e3e)","closed_by":{"login":"dr-jts","id":3529053,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MjkwNTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3529053?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts","html_url":"https://github.com/dr-jts","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dr-jts/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geo